   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Personalisation",
     "texto": [
      "An **anbefalingssystem** suggests content based on the activity patterns of people using the platform. **personalisering** (personalisation) can make the stream relevant, but it can also limit which perspectives are seen."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Spread and responsibility",
     "texto": [
      "The **moderering** of platforms refers to how content is managed. **Rekkevidde** indicates how many people may be exposed to it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
